# Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type: Web application) for the GIS token model.
# This is a PUBLIC client identifier, not a secret — it is embedded in the static
# bundle, which is correct and expected for the GIS token model. NO client secret
# is used by the token model; do not add one.
#
# See SETUP.md for how to create this in the Google Cloud Console with drive.file-only consent.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Client ID.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
